# The stock initramfs is a deliberate exception to *.img: it is the /init the
# kernel needs, it comes from a firmware download that is not in the repo, and
# rebuilding it is not possible without redoing the Colab extraction. 27 MB,
# checked in on purpose.
!stock_ramdisk/
!stock_ramdisk/a24_dyg1_ramdisk.img
